Grori
$cards
DECK 4 SPADES

$initial
GRAISI 8 FACE_HALF
GRAISI 9 FACE_HALF

LEACO 10 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
LEACO 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
LEACO 3 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
LEACO 10 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

OLUC 3 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
OLUC 3 FACE_LAST
OLUC 0 FACE_LAST
OLUC 2 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE LEACO OLUC
OR
    AND
        DESTSRC Suit match
        DEST Suit {CLUBS, DIAMONDS, HEARTS, SPADES}
    SRC Rank 1
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL GRAISI Empty
        PILE ALL GRAISI Empty
    PILE ALL OLUC Empty
